# Ejemplos para adaptar con los ids y el JWT del entorno de desarrollo.
# operationKey: usar otro UUID en una intención nueva; conservarlo en un reintento de red.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = REEMPLAZAR_JWT_DE_SESION
@storeId = REEMPLAZAR_ID_TIENDA
@productId = REEMPLAZAR_ID_PRODUCTO
@orderId = REEMPLAZAR_ID_ORDEN
@operationKey = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### Desactivar producto (propietario)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"INACTIVE"}

### Oferta porcentual (propietario)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stores/{{storeId}}/products/{{productId}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"discountPercentage":25.00,"startsAt":"2026-12-01T09:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-12-15T18:00:00-05:00"}

### Checkout (cliente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/stores/{{storeId}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"invoiceType":"RECEIPT","documentType":"DNI","documentNumber":"12345678"}

### Pago (cliente): cambiar operationKey para esta operación nueva
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sourceId":"tkn_test_ok"}

### Cancelación propia (cliente): otra operationKey
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationKey}}

### Cancelación administrativa (propietario): otra operationKey
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CANCELLED"}
